#. fr: Prisme magique<nbsp>: rubans volants
#. column 0: magicked prism (ribbons)
#. column 2: magicked prisms (ribbons)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Casts a shower of floating ribbons into the air.
msgctxt "Item:48157:0:9"
msgid "Magicked Prism (Ribbons)"
msgstr "Магический призматический кристалл (ленты)"

#. ja: マジックプリズム:コスモエクスプローラー
#. de: Holo-Prisma[p] „Kosmo-Erkundung“
#. fr: prisme magique<nbsp>: exploration cosmique
#. column 2: magicked prisms (cosmic exploration)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Used by ambitious Loporrits for celebratory purposes.
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Cosmic Exploration)
msgctxt "Item:48158:0:0"
msgid "magicked prism (cosmic exploration)"
msgstr "магический призматический кристалл (космические исследования)"

