#. ja: レポリットパラソル
#. de: Loparasol
#. fr: ombrelle loporrite
#. column 2: Loparasols
#. column 8: No matter your distance from the sun, this parasol will protect your skin and nurture your dreams. Use to acquire a Loparasol.
#. column 9: Loparasol
msgctxt "Item:48160:0:0"
msgid "Loparasol"
msgstr "лопорритский зонт"

#. de: Loparasols
#. fr: ombrelles loporrites
