msgctxt "Item:48160:0:9"
msgid "Loparasol"
msgstr "Лопорритский зонт"

#. ja: ホワイトレースパラソル
#. de: weiß[a] Spitz<shy>en<shy>son<shy>nen<shy>schirm
#. fr: ombrelle à dentelles blanche
#. column 2: white embroidered parasols
#. column 8: Because there is no such thing as “too many frills” on a fashion accessory─or so the enigmatic crafter of this parasol believed when they lovingly stitched it together. Use to acquire a white embroidered parasol.
#. column 9: White Embroidered Parasol
msgctxt "Item:48161:0:0"
msgid "white embroidered parasol"
msgstr "белый кружевной зонт"

